{"id":"ln7z6upcbg4cggne2hll96ukk","title":"气候变化加剧或使应对气候危机更难","originalTitle":"The worse climate change gets, the harder it becomes to stop it","summary":"新研究指出，随着气候变化加剧，应对气候危机的难度可能增加。极端天气导致的债务循环可能阻碍气候政策，增加冲突则削弱国际合作。研究建议建立三个阶段的框架来评估和管理脱轨风险，包括识别反馈循环、增强韧性以及制定响应治理策略。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-worse-climate-harder.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-06T18:20:01.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-07T12:11:50.435Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-07T12:11:50.435Z","category":"quantum-physics","tags":["研究成果"],"score":49,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"e3fabcdf-9d82-4cbe-ae5f-f3df132c8a2a","title":"气候变化加剧使应对更难：研究提出三阶段框架"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"e3fabcdf-9d82-4cbe-ae5f-f3df132c8a2a","title":"气候变化加剧使应对更难：研究提出三阶段框架"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fYF-DqHfSR2Y","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}